I'm very pleased to announce hledger 1.99.6 (2.0 preview release 6).
This is the last preview before hledger 2.0, due next month;
by using it, you'll help make 2.0 better!

(hledger is accounting software for both beginners and experts,
using human-readable, version-controllable, future-proof plain text files.
It's dependable, free, fast, friendly, cross-platform, double-entry,
multi-currency, multi-interface, multi-language, GPLv3+-licensed, and fun.
https://hledger.org)

**Highlights**

- reports can be shown as charts in the terminal, as SVG images,
  or in html pages
- --view opens reports in your browser/viewer
- run combines multiple reports into one html
- amounts can be written as arithmetic expressions
- CSV rules can use text processing functions
- holdings supports report intervals, charts, and is faster
- roi computes TWR more robustly
- hledger-web is much more powerful, with charts, a holdings report,
  a report options panel, and hledger-ui-like keyboard shortcuts
- twelve UI languages: Brazilian Portuguese, Chinese, English, French,
  German, Hawaiian, Irish, Italian, Japanese, Russian, Spanish and Ukrainian.

